{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle game that sits at the bottom of your screen, without interrupting your daily studies or work. Research technologies, grow crops, automate production, and use a variety of machinery to craft items, fend off monsters, and conquer the apocalypse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting crops:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a variety of crops. Obtain seeds and plant them in your newly tilled farmland. This is a vital source of food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/8f0052c51b708055e651a4b24e7b414a.poster.avif?t=1760890731\" width=630 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/8f0052c51b708055e651a4b24e7b414a.webm?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/8f0052c51b708055e651a4b24e7b414a.mp4?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building an electrical system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shelter and automation drones/robots require power. Build generators and charging stations to keep them running!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/ca4fa46d7bd02787b4483d0c3c08bd95.poster.avif?t=1760890731\" width=630 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/ca4fa46d7bd02787b4483d0c3c08bd95.webm?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/ca4fa46d7bd02787b4483d0c3c08bd95.mp4?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Robots Work For You:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy cute drones or robots to help collect resources, farm, and explore the map. More machines to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/324ae4c68e0f96bbc252078efe9ea8b7.poster.avif?t=1760890731\" width=630 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/324ae4c68e0f96bbc252078efe9ea8b7.webm?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/324ae4c68e0f96bbc252078efe9ea8b7.mp4?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction and production:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from the wild, craft essential items, and build up your shelter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/43780186f28832cce836f9549366ad7a.poster.avif?t=1760890731\" width=630 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/43780186f28832cce836f9549366ad7a.webm?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080430/extras/43780186f28832cce836f9549366ad7a.mp4?t=1760890731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against attacks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the shelter grows, <strong>it attracts monsters! Upgrade your weapons, now!</strong></